{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:<module>\tObserve model attribution below the real ``RunnerAgentStep`` by recording post-resolution ``req.config.model`` values; distinct class-table sentinels must distinguish declared model classes from fallback to ``cfg.model``.\tPASS\t206\t33\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:class_table\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:class_table\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:class_table\tClear ambient model overrides before installing distinct trivial, standard, and frontier sentinels so the attribution test remains hermetic.\tPASS\t38\t9\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:_RecordingRunner\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:_RecordingRunner\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py#D:_RecordingRunner\tRecord each post-resolution model together with the executor-bound step identifier consumed by usage attribution.\tPASS\t48\t9\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:<module>\tKeep the production interpreter, ``RunnerAgentStep``, and ``PydanticAIRunner`` in the offline path. Usage rows expose step and class identity, while the ``_pai_model`` observation records each resolved model.\tPASS\t272\t41\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:_offline_model\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:_offline_model\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:_offline_model\tReturn the shared payload through either native output-tool or prompted structured-output handling without entering a tool loop.\tPASS\t72\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_distinguishes_the_two_batch_passes\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_distinguishes_the_two_batch_passes\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_distinguishes_the_two_batch_passes\tRound A and Round B share prompt names, so the recorded ``step`` field must distinguish their usage rows.\tPASS\t77\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_records_the_declared_class_when_the_model_came_from_one\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_records_the_declared_class_when_the_model_came_from_one\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#D:test_usage_log_records_the_declared_class_when_the_model_came_from_one\tEvery usage row, including each batch overlay call, must retain the declared model class.\tPASS\t80\t12\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#C:<module>:before:_PAYLOAD\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#C:<module>:before:_PAYLOAD\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py#C:<module>:before:_PAYLOAD\tUse one schema-superset response for all gate steps so the fake does not condition its content on the step identity being tested.\tPASS\t85\t18\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:<module>\tRunner-produced provider provenance must travel through the real gate verdict into the sidecar without configuration-based reconstruction. Model-free paths omit it, and finalization may recover the observed verify-step record.\tPASS\t225\t52\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_code_review_yaml_wires_provenance_from_an_agent_step\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_code_review_yaml_wires_provenance_from_an_agent_step\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_code_review_yaml_wires_provenance_from_an_agent_step\tVerdict assembly must source provider provenance from an agent step whose outputs carry the runner-produced record.\tPASS\t61\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:gate_verdict\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:gate_verdict\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:gate_verdict\tRun the production code-review gate and interpreter with only the model replaced by an offline double, returning the actual terminal verdict.\tPASS\t63\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_a_real_gate_verdict_carries_provenance_into_the_sidecar_payload\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_a_real_gate_verdict_carries_provenance_into_the_sidecar_payload\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_a_real_gate_verdict_carries_provenance_into_the_sidecar_payload\tGate-produced provenance must survive real sidecar construction and serialization unchanged.\tPASS\t58\t9\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_the_degraded_verdict_omits_provenance_rather_than_deriving_one\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_the_degraded_verdict_omits_provenance_rather_than_deriving_one\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_the_degraded_verdict_omits_provenance_rather_than_deriving_one\tA model-free outage verdict must omit provider provenance rather than claiming that configured intent served the run.\tPASS\t55\t8\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_finalize_recovers_the_runners_record_for_an_unwired_verdict\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_finalize_recovers_the_runners_record_for_an_unwired_verdict\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py#D:test_finalize_recovers_the_runners_record_for_an_unwired_verdict\tFinalization recovers the observed provider record from the succeeded verify step without resolving a new record.\tPASS\t58\t11\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:<module>\tCompletion precheck preserves caller-owned graph scope: close verification uses ``graph=False`` for the ticket itself, direct workflow calls default false, and ``verify_completion`` resolves epic-wide scope upstream.\tPASS\t110\t30\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:test_precheck_defaults_to_false_when_graph_not_threaded\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:test_precheck_defaults_to_false_when_graph_not_threaded\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py#D:test_precheck_defaults_to_false_when_graph_not_threaded\tWithout an explicit graph scope, precheck verifies only the current ticket.\tPASS\t38\t10\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#D:<module>\tFailing completion runs must retain consumed request, tool-call, and duration metrics in the observable sidecar payload using an offline usage-reporting runner.\tPASS\t114\t24\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#C:test_sanitize_diagnostic_admits_consumed_counters:before:from rebar.llm.failure import sanitize_diagnostic\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#C:test_sanitize_diagnostic_admits_consumed_counters:before:from rebar.llm.failure import sanitize_diagnostic\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py#C:test_sanitize_diagnostic_admits_consumed_counters:before:from rebar.llm.failure import sanitize_diagnostic\tDiagnostic sanitization preserves consumed counters, rejects unknown fields, and retains string-redaction behavior.\tPASS\t48\t11\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:<module>\tA provider outage after an actionable bank entry finalizes a deterministic BLOCK; empty, PASS-only, and insufficient banks retain the retryable error path without billable calls.\tPASS\t147\t33\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:test_actionable_bank_outage_degrades_to_deterministic_block\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:test_actionable_bank_outage_degrades_to_deterministic_block\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py#D:test_actionable_bank_outage_degrades_to_deterministic_block\tAn actionable refutation followed by outage produces a non-certifiable FAIL from the bank without another model call.\tPASS\t44\t12\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#D:<module>\tRetryable completion outages retain disposition through the raised-error path so ``close_precheck`` selects retry handling; raw botocore read and connect timeouts are classified without importing botocore.\tPASS\t129\t30\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#C:<module>:before:def _timeout_exc\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#C:<module>:before:def _timeout_exc\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py#C:<module>:before:def _timeout_exc\tOnly botocore-module read and connect timeout exception names receive retryable transport classification.\tPASS\t75\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:<module>\tAttested completion prefetch reads declared files and discovered test globs from the active pinned code root even when ``repo_root`` names another checkout; local mode keeps the supplied root.\tPASS\t108\t36\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:_fixture\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:_fixture\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py#D:_fixture\tCreate divergent live and pinned roots with a discoverable test file present only in the pinned snapshot.\tPASS\t59\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:<module>\tCompletion recovery enforces a physical ceiling derived from twice the resolved verifier model own window and an economic ceiling over context length times criterion count; unknown models use the smallest ladder window.\tPASS\t204\t36\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_returns_the_matched_models_own_window\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_returns_the_matched_models_own_window\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_returns_the_matched_models_own_window\tUse the matched verifier model own context window rather than the larger plan-review escalation maximum.\tPASS\t53\t12\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_falls_back_to_the_ladder_minimum_for_unknown_models\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_falls_back_to_the_ladder_minimum_for_unknown_models\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py#D:test_own_window_accessor_falls_back_to_the_ladder_minimum_for_unknown_models\tUnrecognized and empty model identifiers inherit the smallest ladder window.\tPASS\t46\t7\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:<module>\tLarge legitimate tickets reach bounded recovery with their context unmodified. The criteria ceiling stays within the model-derived context ceiling, and over-budget payloads fail before recovery calls.\tPASS\t318\t30\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:_realistic_context\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:_realistic_context\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:_realistic_context\tBuild ticket-shaped context containing acceptance criteria and accumulated evidence comments rather than a degenerate repeated-character blob.\tPASS\t44\t10\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_the_full_context_reaches_the_model_with_nothing_elided\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_the_full_context_reaches_the_model_with_nothing_elided\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_the_full_context_reaches_the_model_with_nothing_elided\tEvery per-criterion evidence request must carry the complete assembled context byte for byte.\tPASS\t33\t12\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_an_over_budget_payload_still_fails_before_any_billable_call\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_an_over_budget_payload_still_fails_before_any_billable_call\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#D:test_an_over_budget_payload_still_fails_before_any_billable_call\tContext above the resolved model physical ceiling is rejected before any recovery request, preserving the cost guard.\tPASS\t43\t10\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#C:<module>:before:_DEFAULT_CONTEXT_CEILING\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#C:<module>:before:_DEFAULT_CONTEXT_CEILING\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py#C:<module>:before:_DEFAULT_CONTEXT_CEILING\tDerive the physical context ceiling from the resolved default verifier model rather than a hard-coded flat limit.\tPASS\t48\t10\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_prelude_215f.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_prelude_215f.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_prelude_215f.py#D:<module>\tA recovery-prelude ticket-read failure becomes ``CompletionRecoveryError``, populates ``failure_diagnostic``, and preserves primary-run budget and repetition counters for the error sidecar.\tPASS\t82\t28\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#D:test_short_run_exhaustion_still_renders_repetition\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#D:test_short_run_exhaustion_still_renders_repetition\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#D:test_short_run_exhaustion_still_renders_repetition\tShort exhausted runs render their concrete repetition counters without an unavailable ratio or literal ``None`` placeholder.\tPASS\t52\t11\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#C:<module>:before:class _BudgetExhaustedRunner\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#C:<module>:before:class _BudgetExhaustedRunner\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py#C:<module>:before:class _BudgetExhaustedRunner\tOnly typed ``LLMBudgetExhaustedError`` enters bounded completion recovery; an ordinary runner error with similar text still propagates.\tPASS\t85\t10\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:<module>\tValidated PASS verdicts cache by criterion-text hash and scoped content fingerprint. Non-PASS entries are excluded; owned, child, tree, missing-path, Git-failure, and concurrent-write rules preserve safe reuse.\tPASS\t142\t72\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:test_concurrent_persist_for_same_criterion_loses_no_writer\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:test_concurrent_persist_for_same_criterion_loses_no_writer\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py#D:test_concurrent_persist_for_same_criterion_loses_no_writer\tTwo concurrent writers for one ticket and criterion both persist; per-write temporary paths prevent one atomic replace from consuming the other writer file while retaining last-write-wins semantics.\tPASS\t99\t37\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#D:<module>\tThe completion workflow validates, short-circuits unclosed children before LLM work, runs verification through normalize/citation/reconcile/validate, enforces findings-verdict consistency, and withholds certification for uncertified closure evidence offline.\tPASS\t129\t62\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:def _fake_list\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:def _fake_list\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:def _fake_list\tThe list stub matches the full keyword-only read surface: parent queries feed closure and traversal, while bug queries see an empty store.\tPASS\t53\t21\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:monkeypatch.setattr\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:monkeypatch.setattr\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:_patch_rebar:before:monkeypatch.setattr\tThe signature stub accepts ``kind`` because child closure requests a completion-verifier signature; otherwise the certified branch would fall into the uncertified exception path.\tPASS\t38\t17\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_certified_child_is_certifiable:before:runner = _CannedRunner\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_certified_child_is_certifiable:before:runner = _CannedRunner\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_certified_child_is_certifiable:before:runner = _CannedRunner\tA certified child permits the parent own-criteria LLM check and leaves its passing verdict certifiable; accepting ``kind`` keeps this on the genuine certified branch.\tPASS\t65\t26\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:from rebar.llm.completion import child_closure_findings\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:from rebar.llm.completion import child_closure_findings\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:from rebar.llm.completion import child_closure_findings\tA child-enumeration read error must not launder the parent as childless: closure on its own criteria may continue, but certification must be withheld.\tPASS\t80\t25\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:blocking\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:blocking\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:blocking\tThe direct child-closure contract returns no fabricated blocker and a nonempty uncertified set on read failure.\tPASS\t40\t16\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:runner = _CannedRunner\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:runner = _CannedRunner\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py#C:test_child_enumeration_read_error_withholds_certification:before:runner = _CannedRunner\tEnd-to-end, the parent own-criteria LLM check still runs and can PASS, but the resulting verdict remains uncertifiable.\tPASS\t33\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_det_short_circuit.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_det_short_circuit.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_det_short_circuit.py#D:<module>\tAny deterministic blocking finding stops plan review before finder or agent calls and all DET blockers remain in the verdict; a DET-passing plan still executes LLM passes using offline imported fixtures.\tPASS\t120\t46\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_built_bundle_carries_structured_field_paths:before:if not editor.assets_available()\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_built_bundle_carries_structured_field_paths:before:if not editor.assets_available()\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_built_bundle_carries_structured_field_paths:before:if not editor.assets_available()\tThe built editor bundle exposes structured field and validation paths and contains no raw JSON editor; browser tests retain the interaction-level consumer.\tPASS\t73\t19\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_reference_writes_raw_id_no_overlay:before:repo\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_reference_writes_raw_id_no_overlay:before:repo\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_reference_writes_raw_id_no_overlay:before:repo\tA criterion reference without routing writes its rubric at the raw identifier and creates no activation overlay.\tPASS\t54\t17\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_routing_still_requires_project_prefix:before:_repo\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_routing_still_requires_project_prefix:before:_repo\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_criterion_routing_still_requires_project_prefix:before:_repo\tRouted criteria require a ``project.*`` identifier and write both the sanitized rubric filename and routing overlay.\tPASS\t32\t16\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_refuses_bad_glob_code_review_project_criterion:before:repo\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_refuses_bad_glob_code_review_project_criterion:before:repo\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_refuses_bad_glob_code_review_project_criterion:before:repo\tInvalid code-review ``applies_to`` globs return the repository-wide remedy before writing either rubric or routing overlay.\tPASS\t40\t16\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_authors_code_review_criterion_under_the_code_review_gate:before:repo\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_authors_code_review_criterion_under_the_code_review_gate:before:repo\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py#C:test_library_create_authors_code_review_criterion_under_the_code_review_gate:before:repo\tA valid code-review criterion is stored and activated under its declared code-review gate rather than ``plan_review``.\tPASS\t35\t13\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor_batch.py#C:<module>:before:def test_authoring_a_valid_repository_wide_code_review_criterion_succeeds\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_batch.py#C:<module>:before:def test_authoring_a_valid_repository_wide_code_review_criterion_succeeds\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_batch.py#C:<module>:before:def test_authoring_a_valid_repository_wide_code_review_criterion_succeeds\tProject code-review LLM criteria require nonempty repository-relative ``applies_to`` globs and recommend ``[\"**\"]`` for repository-wide coverage; plan-review, DET, and built-in authoring rules remain separate.\tPASS\t77\t31\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#D:<module>\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#D:<module>\tThe read-only effective-policy projection exposes snapshot digest/source plus criterion gate, tier, posture, applicability, enabled state, and provenance while excluding review results, discovery data, prompt/context/provider/detector bodies, and secrets.\tPASS\t130\t57\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_is_available_and_digest_bound\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_is_available_and_digest_bound\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_is_available_and_digest_bound\tThe snapshot digest binds the narrow effective-policy projection to the same compiled policy source.\tPASS\t14\t8\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments\ntests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_reports_scoped_glob_applicability\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_reports_scoped_glob_applicability\t696b6834d93e12635a27a3280cfc836f4019c8e1:tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py#C:<module>:before:def test_effective_view_reports_scoped_glob_applicability\tScoped globs retain scoped applicability instead of being summarized as repository-wide.\tPASS\t10\t5\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/review_goldfilled_comments"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788793840370501518,"uuid":"dc17072e-16c4-440a-8479-77778d026e88"}